msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Block previews** | Otter, Essential Blocks, Spectra, Kadence, GenerateBlocks, Stackable | Real front-end styling in island previews |"
msgstr "| **区块预览** | Otter、Essential Blocks、Spectra、Kadence、GenerateBlocks、Stackable | 岛屿预览中的真实前端样式 |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:39
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Block libraries** | Stackable, Kadence, GenerateBlocks | Design library in the editor's Browse-all; open to any plugin via __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ |"
