#: docs/plugin-support.md:31
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Backups** | UpdraftPlus, Disembark, Duplicator, WPvivid, BackWPup, All-in-One WP Migration | **Backups** surface; health check + \"Back up now\" (UpdraftPlus, else WPvivid); status card, CLI command, sessions + cleanup, and on Disembark 2.8+ a **Restore a backup** deep-link (Disembark); package list with disk sizes, status card and delete-through-its-own-cleanup (Duplicator, no freshness claims: manual builds); backup list + status card + schedule + backup-now + delete-through-its-own-cleanup (WPvivid); local FOLDER archives + run-job-now + delete through their destination (BackWPup); local .wpress export list + delete through their Backups model, no freshness claims (All-in-One WP Migration; export/import stay deep links) |"
msgstr "| **备份** | UpdraftPlus、Disembark、Duplicator、WPvivid、BackWPup、All-in-One WP Migration | **Backups** 界面；健康检查 + 「立即备份」（UpdraftPlus，否则 WPvivid）；状态卡片、CLI 命令、会话 + 清理，以及 Disembark 2.8+ 中的**恢复备份**深层链接（Disembark）；软件包列表及磁盘大小、状态卡片和通过自身清理功能删除（Duplicator，不声明新鲜度：手动构建）；备份列表 + 状态卡片 + 计划 + 立即备份 + 通过自身清理功能删除（WPvivid）；本地 FOLDER 归档 + 立即运行任务 + 通过其目标位置删除（BackWPup）；本地 .wpress 导出列表 + 通过其 Backups 模型删除，不声明新鲜度（All-in-One WP Migration；导出/导入仍使用深层链接） |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:30
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Analytics** | Koko, WP Statistics, Burst, Independent Analytics, AnalyticsWP, **Matomo**, **Site Kit**, **Jetpack Stats** | Overview **Traffic** chart (daily visitors/pageviews). Day-click drill-down (top pages + referrers via __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__): **Koko**, **WP Statistics** (hits only per URI), **Burst** (__MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ + session referrers), **Independent Analytics** (views × resources + session referrers), **Matomo** (their own reporting API — Bootstrap + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__, gated on __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__; numbers match their UI including its hourly archiving cadence), **Jetpack Stats** (WPCOM_Stats blog-token client, gated on connection + stats module + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_5__; per-page counts are views-only by WPCOM design) |"
msgstr "| **分析** | Koko、WP Statistics、Burst、Independent Analytics、AnalyticsWP、**Matomo**、**Site Kit**、**Jetpack Stats** | 概览**流量**图表（每日访客数/页面浏览量）。点击日期进行下钻（热门页面 + 通过 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 获取的来源）：**Koko**、**WP Statistics**（每个 URI 仅统计点击数）、**Burst**（__MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ + 会话来源）、**Independent Analytics**（浏览量 × 资源 + 会话来源）、**Matomo**（其自身的报告 API——Bootstrap + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__，由 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__ 控制；数字与其界面一致，包括其每小时归档节奏）、**Jetpack Stats**（WPCOM_Stats 博客令牌客户端，由连接 + stats 模块 + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_5__ 控制；按页面统计仅包含浏览量，这是 WPCOM 的设计） |"

#: docs/plugin-support.md:27
msgctxt "docs/plugin-support.md"
msgid "| **Activity log** | Simple History, WP Activity Log, Aryo, Stream, **Wordfence**, **Limit Login Attempts Reloaded**, **Solid Security**, **All-In-One Security** | **Activity Log** surface — severity/level tabs (Simple History, WSAL, AIOS), connector tabs (Stream), action tabs (Aryo); every provider has a **status card** (audit logs: 24h / 7d / all-time + last event and a family-specific mix; Wordfence: 24h logins + firewall/scan posture; Limit Login Attempts and Solid Security: lockouts now + policy/protection, with one-click Unlock/Release through each plugin's own store). AIOS reads its audit-log table with JSON details flattened to context rows, and reports **failed logins (24h)**, **locked out now**, and **permanent blocks** (System health row too; deep-links into AIOS for management) |"
msgstr "| **活动日志** | Simple History、WP Activity Log、Aryo、Stream、**Wordfence**、**Limit Login Attempts Reloaded**、**Solid Security**、**All-In-One Security** | **Activity Log** 界面——严重性/级别选项卡（Simple History、WSAL、AIOS）、连接器选项卡（Stream）、操作选项卡（Aryo）；每个提供商都有一个**状态卡片**（审计日志：24 小时 / 7 天 / 全部时间 + 最近事件及类别特定的组合；Wordfence：24 小时登录 + 防火墙/扫描状态；Limit Login Attempts 和 Solid Security：当前锁定数 + 策略/保护，并通过各插件自身的存储提供一键解锁/释放）。AIOS 读取其审计日志表，并将 JSON 详情扁平化为上下文行，同时报告**失败登录（24 小时）**、**当前锁定**和**永久阻止**（系统健康行也会显示；深层链接进入 AIOS 进行管理） |"

