#: docs/adapter-coverage.md:200
msgctxt "docs/adapter-coverage.md"
msgid "| 2026-08-06 | scrutoscope: onto their 1.5 list API (vendor-reported, GitHub issue #3) | Axis B, prompted by the plugin author. Scrutoscope 1.5.0 added __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ specifically so integrators stop reading the table; list now rides it through __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ (gated on __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__, the shaper their contract names), status totals via __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__. **The win is not tidiness: their output Sanitizer runs on that path and did not run on ours** (reduced SQL + host-only HTTP URLs are re-applied at read time as defense-in-depth for rows written by older builds; a direct SELECT is what skips it). Same pass fixed a self-inflicted gap: Minimal's own \"Profile this hook\" writes __MA_DOC_TOKEN_5__ but the tabs were pinned/session/background, so Minimal's captures were findable under All profiles only. Added the On demand tab plus a Context column from __MA_DOC_TOKEN_6__. Column read kept for pre-1.5. Suite scrutoscope 29→34. |"
msgstr "| 2026-08-06 | scrutoscope：接入其 1.5 列表 API（供应商报告，GitHub issue #3） | 轴 B，由插件作者推动。Scrutoscope 1.5.0 特别新增了 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__，以便集成方停止读取数据表；列表现在通过 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ 使用该接口（以 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__ 为门控，即其契约命名的整形器），状态总数通过 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__ 获取。**收益不在于整洁：其输出 Sanitizer 会在该路径运行，而我们的路径不会**（对于旧版本写入的行，缩减后的 SQL + 仅主机 HTTP URL 会在读取时重新应用，作为纵深防御；直接 SELECT 会跳过它）。同一轮还修复了一个 Minimal 自身造成的缺口：「Profile this hook」写入 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_5__，但标签页固定为 pinned/session/background，因此 Minimal 的采集结果只能在「All profiles」下找到。新增 On demand 标签页，并从 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_6__ 添加 Context 列。保留列读取，以兼容 1.5 之前的版本。套件 scrutoscope 29→34。 |"

#: docs/adapter-coverage.md:203
msgctxt "docs/adapter-coverage.md"
msgid "| 2026-08-06 | WPForms Pro entries adapter (ship top 1, fourth slice — the last big forms name) | adapters/wpforms.php: full forms-family treatment. Reads = prefix-scoped SELECTs (search LIKE over the fields JSON); WRITES through their __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ handler (update/delete — hooks fire, delete cleans entry_fields + entry_meta, verified rows-left=0). Caps defer to __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__ (view_entries/edit_entries/delete_entries; editor = 403 + hidden surface, empirically checked). HARD-WON: __MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__ column is UTC (14:22 stored at 10:22 EDT) → emit ISO Z + column utc:true; display status derives spam/trash-win-else-viewed; opening a detail marks viewed through their update (their screen's behavior; never for spam/trash); their __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__ search machinery deliberately NOT used (advanced-search complexity; LIKE matches their fallback). Star/unstar as when-gated actions on a '★' item key. Registers only when the entry handler exists (Lite = nothing). SUITE GOTCHA: execSync + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_5__ with a JSON.stringify'd arg lets the shell expand __MA_DOC_TOKEN_6__/__MA_DOC_TOKEN_7__ to empty — the suite's wp() helper writes a temp file + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_8__; and the forms-family detail modal is a CONTACT CARD (renderEntryDetail — no \"Answers\" heading; assert card content). Suites: wpforms 16, forms-status 14. |"
msgstr "| 2026-08-06 | WPForms Pro 条目适配器（首发第 1 个、第四批——最后一个大型表单产品名） | adapters/wpforms.php：完整处理表单系列。读取 = 按前缀限定的 SELECT（对 fields JSON 使用 LIKE 搜索）；写入通过其 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ 处理器（更新/删除——钩子会触发，删除会清理 entry_fields + entry_meta，已验证剩余行数=0）。权限遵循 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_2__（view_entries/edit_entries/delete_entries；编辑器 = 403 + 隐藏界面，已通过实测检查）。来之不易的发现：__MA_DOC_TOKEN_3__ 列使用 UTC（10:22 EDT 存储为 14:22）→ 输出 ISO Z + 列 utc:true；显示状态由 spam/trash，否则为 viewed；打开详情会通过其更新操作标记为已查看（其界面行为；spam/trash 永不执行）；其 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_4__ 搜索机制有意不使用（高级搜索复杂；LIKE 匹配其回退逻辑）。对带有「★」项目键的条目按网关条件执行加星/取消加星。仅在条目处理器存在时注册（Lite = 不注册）。测试套件注意事项：使用 execSync + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_5__ 和 JSON.stringify 后的参数会让 shell 将 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_6__/__MA_DOC_TOKEN_7__ 展开为空——套件的 wp() 辅助函数会写入临时文件 + __MA_DOC_TOKEN_8__；表单系列详情模态框是联系人卡片（renderEntryDetail——没有「Answers」标题；断言卡片内容）。套件：wpforms 16，forms-status 14。 |"

