#: docs/adapter-coverage.md:190
msgctxt "docs/adapter-coverage.md"
msgid "| 2026-07-17 | Wave D: media folders contract + FileBird | New provider filter __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__ (first-non-null, traffic-style; documented in the author guide + Integrations listeners): folders() flat list w/ parent+count (id 0 reserved = Uncategorized), ids(folder). Core routes GET media/folders (tree-ordered w/ depth) + media/folders/{id}/ids (newest-500 cap, capped flag) → client folder combobox filtering via include= (empty folder short-circuits — include= with no ids means no filter). FileBird provider rides its OWN model (allFolders/countAttachments/verifyAuthor/getAttachmentIdsByFolderId; per-user mode via their fbv_folder_created_by filter; uncategorized mirrors their scoped NOT IN clause). SUITE SEEDS THROUGH FILEBIRD'S OWN REST (filebird/v1 new-folder/assign-folder/delete-folder, upload_files + nonce): suite media-folders (12). FileBird ACTIVE fixture. Move-to-folder + RML/Premio providers = follow-ups |"
msgstr "| 2026-07-17 | Wave D：媒体文件夹契约 + FileBird | 新 provider 筛选器 __MA_DOC_TOKEN_1__（first-non-null，traffic 风格；已记录在作者指南 + Integrations listeners 中）：folders() 返回带 parent+count 的扁平列表（id 0 保留为 Uncategorized），ids(folder)。核心路由 GET media/folders（按树排序并包含 depth）+ media/folders/{id}/ids（最多 500 个，带 capped 标志）→客户端通过 include= 使用文件夹组合框进行筛选（空文件夹直接结束——没有 ID 的 include= 表示不筛选）。FileBird provider 使用其自己的模型（allFolders/countAttachments/verifyAuthor/getAttachmentIdsByFolderId；通过其 fbv_folder_created_by filter 支持按用户模式；未分类项复刻其限定范围的 NOT IN 子句）。测试套件通过 FileBird 自己的 REST 写入 fixture（filebird/v1 new-folder/assign-folder/delete-folder，upload_files + nonce）：测试套件 media-folders（12）。FileBird ACTIVE fixture。移动到文件夹 + RML/Premio providers = 后续工作 |"

